# PROJECT: MYLIFEHUB
## Complete Personal Life Management Platform

You are an expert full-stack software architect, senior React developer, Firebase engineer, AI engineer, UI/UX designer, security engineer, and QA specialist.

Your task is to design, develop, test, and deliver a complete, functional, production-oriented web application named **MyLifeHub**.

MyLifeHub is an integrated personal life management platform combining four intelligent modules:

1. DocuMind – Intelligent Document Management.
2. SpendSense – Personal Financial Management.
3. FixFlow – Household Asset and Maintenance Management.
4. PantryPilot – Grocery and Inventory Management.

The application must integrate all four modules into one unified platform using a shared database, authentication system, AI intelligence layer, and automation engine.

This is a serious individual development project. Prioritize practical functionality, maintainability, security, reliability, exceptional UI/UX, and clean architecture.

Do not create four independent applications.

Do not deliver a static dashboard or frontend-only demonstration.

Build a working full-stack application.

