# 1. PRODUCT VISION

Product name: MyLifeHub

Tagline: Your Personal Life. One Intelligent Hub.

Product type: Personal Life Management Platform.

Target users: Individuals and households.

Platform: Responsive web application.

Storage: Secure cloud-based storage.

AI: Google Gemini API.

Automation: Rule-based intelligence combined with AI-assisted workflows.

Currency: Multi-currency support.

The application should help users manage personal documents, finances, household assets, groceries, reminders, and everyday information from one centralized platform.

The main principle is:

ENTER INFORMATION ONCE. REUSE IT INTELLIGENTLY THROUGHOUT MYLIFEHUB.

Example:

When a user uploads a refrigerator purchase invoice, MyLifeHub should be capable of extracting the purchase information, suggesting a financial transaction, suggesting a new household asset, identifying warranty details, and scheduling reminders.

The user must review and approve important cross-module actions before they are committed.

